title: "compcat: reproduction code for machine-learning screening of high-entropy alloy catalysts"
abstract: >-
  Reference diagnostics, sampling-design tests and offset-invariant descriptors
  for a 646,000-configuration machine-learning screen of high-entropy alloys for
  dry methane reforming.
